            "text": "<p>The ADHD Clarity Duo is designed to support focus, concentration, and natural motivation. Combining our Dopamine and Focus Patches, this complementary system helps support mental clarity, cognitive performance, and sustained attention, so you can stay organized, productive, and engaged throughout the day. Each vegan bundle contains <strong>30</strong> <strong>Dopamine</strong> <strong>Patches</strong> and <strong>30</strong> <strong>Focus</strong> <strong>Patches</strong>, offering a simple, convenient alternative to pills and gummies. </p><h3></h3><p></p><p></p><p></p>"
